id: saiyan-tail-resistance
name: Saiyan Tail Resistance
talentCategory: racial
race: saiyan
prerequisites: Saiyan, Tailed chosen for the 5th effect of Saiyan Heritage
# Lost as Saiyan Heritage's Option becomes Tailless: its Progression row emptied, another Talent the player's (dbu-ttrpg.mjs).
tailedOnly: true
description: >
  You have overcome the inherent weakness of your tail.
text: >
  Saiyan Tail Resistance: You have overcome the inherent weakness of your tail.
  –Prerequisites: Saiyan, Tailed chosen for the 5th effect of Saiyan Heritage
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Soak Value by 1(bT).
  (2)-[Passive]: Ignore the 4th effect of Saiyan Heritage.
  (3)-[Automatic]: If your effect for the Option effect of Saiyan Heritage becomes Tailless, lose this Talent and gain another Talent that you meet the Prerequisites for.

---

[passive]
# (1)
soakValue += 1(bT);
# (2) Grabbed by the Tail: not knocked Prone, nor held so - the Tail Restraint itself still keeps the Tail Attack shut (chat.mjs).
allow tailResistance.ignore;
# (3) Its header's `tailedOnly`.
